* osdi_bind: a numeric fourth node on a D line is a node, not the unlabeled area

* dummy_bjt of dummy_modules.c conducts 3 mS from its first to its third terminal
.model diode_four_terminals d level=24

v_diode_numeric_nodes diode_numeric_nodes 0 1
d_diode_numeric_nodes diode_numeric_nodes 0 0 0 diode_four_terminals

.control
pre_osdi dummy_modules.osdi
pre_osdi_bind dio 24 dummy_bjt
op
print i(v_diode_numeric_nodes)
.endc

.end
